---
permalink: lazare.html
---
{% from "macros.njk" import themeMark %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="LAZARE, chantier de diagnostic et réemploi de l'Atelier. Premier dossier : le sauvetage d'un disque externe LaCie 1 To.">
<title>LAZARE · Diagnostic & restauration | L'Atelier</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="atelier.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="lazare.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="rrt4-lexicon.css">
<script src="page-transition.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="theme-workshop lazare-page">
{% include "atelier-header.njk" %}
<nav class="lz-breadcrumb" aria-label="Fil d’Ariane">
  <a href="index.html#index">PORTFOLIO IT</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
  <a href="atelier.html">L’ATELIER</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
  <span aria-current="page">LAZARE</span>
</nav>
<main id="content">
<header class="lz-hero">
  <div class="lz-hero-main">
    <div class="lz-kicker">WORKSHOP / REPAIR / ARCHIVE <span>LAZARE · {{ lazare.edition }}</span></div>
    <div class="lz-hero-name">
      <div>
        <span class="lz-label">DIAGNOSTIC / RESTAURATION / PRÉSERVATION</span>
        <h1>LAZARE<span class="lz-period">.</span></h1>
        <p class="lz-acronym"><b>L.A.Z.A.R.E.</b> / {{ lazare.acronym }}</p>
        <p class="lz-hero-line">Avant de remplacer,<br><strong>comprendre ce qui a lâché.</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="lz-character" aria-hidden="true"><div class="lz-character-orbit"></div>
        {{ themeMark("repair") | safe }}
        <div class="lz-character-stamp"><span>LOOK</span><span>AGAIN</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lz-hero-lede">{{ lazare.mission }}</p>
    <div class="lz-hero-tags"><span>FIELD LOG</span><span>REUSE FIRST</span><span>NON-DESTRUCTIVE BY DEFAULT</span></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="lz-hero-side" aria-label="État du projet">
    <div class="lz-aside-top"><span>SYSTEM STATE</span><b>{{ lazare.edition }}</b></div>
    <div class="lz-aside-body">
      <div class="lz-aside-status"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ lazare.status }}</div>
      <div class="lz-aside-number">{{ lazare.cases | length | pad2 }}</div>
      <p>CAS DOCUMENTÉ{% if lazare.cases | length > 1 %}S{% endif %}<br>ET D’AUTRES MACHINES À EXAMINER.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lz-aside-bottom">
      <span class="lz-language lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="修复" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="xiūfù" data-rrt4-meaning="Réparer, restaurer">修复</span>
      <div>DIAGNOSE / PRESERVE / REBUILD / RECORD</div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</header>
<div class="lz-marquee" aria-label="Méthode"><span>OBSERVE → ISOLATE → PRESERVE → VERIFY</span><span>FIELD REGISTER / ATELIER</span></div>
<section class="lz-intro" id="mission">
  <div class="lz-section-label"><b>00 / THE WORKSHOP</b><span class="lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="工作室" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="gōngzuòshì" data-rrt4-meaning="Atelier">工作室</span><span>Le chantier</span></div>
  <div class="lz-intro-copy">
    <h2>Une seconde vie,<br><em>pas un miracle.</em></h2>
    {% for paragraph in lazare.introduction %}<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>{% endfor %}
    <a class="lz-text-link" href="#case-001">CONSULTER LE PREMIER DOSSIER <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><p class="lz-discovery-hint"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> SURVOLE LES CARACTÈRES <span lang="zh-Hans">中文</span> POUR DÉCOUVRIR LEUR LECTURE.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lz-method" id="protocol">
  <div class="lz-section-heading"><div><span class="lz-small">01 / PROTOCOL</span><h2>La méthode.</h2></div><span class="lz-section-symbol lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="流程" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="liúchéng" data-rrt4-meaning="Processus, démarche">流程</span></div>
  <div class="lz-method-grid">
    {% for item in lazare.method %}
    <article class="lz-method-card">
      <span class="lz-stepnum">{{ item.num }} / {{ item.title }}</span>
      <h3>{{ item.subtitle }}</h3>
      <p>{{ item.body }}</p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lz-register" id="register">
  <div class="lz-section-heading"><div><span class="lz-small">02 / CASE REGISTER</span><h2>Les interventions.</h2></div><span class="lz-section-symbol lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="记录" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="jìlù" data-rrt4-meaning="Journal, consignation">记录</span></div>
  <div class="lz-index">
    {% for entry in lazare.cases %}
    <a href="#case-{{ entry.id }}" class="lz-index-row">
      <span>CASE {{ entry.id }}</span><strong>{{ entry.title }}</strong><small>{{ entry.type }}</small><span>{{ entry.badge }} ↗</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% for entry in lazare.cases %}
<article class="lz-case" id="case-{{ entry.id }}">
  <header class="lz-case-head">
    <div class="lz-case-main">
      <div class="lz-case-meta">CASE {{ entry.id }} / {{ entry.date }} / {{ entry.type }}</div>
      <span class="lz-case-kicker">{{ entry.subtitle }}</span>
      <h2>{{ entry.title }}<span>.</span></h2>
      <p class="lz-case-hook">{{ entry.hook }}</p>
      <div class="lz-case-badges"><b>{{ entry.badge }}</b><span>{{ entry.badgeSub }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="lz-case-aside">
      <span class="lz-aside-tag">REPAIR REPORT / {{ entry.id }}</span>
      <div class="lz-disc-art" role="img" aria-label="Schéma abstrait d'un disque dur mécanique, illustration et non photo de preuve"><span class="lz-disc-watermark" aria-hidden="true">SCHEMATIC / 01</span>
        <div class="lz-disc-ring"><div></div></div><div class="lz-disc-head"></div>
        <small>HDD / SATA</small>
      </div>
      <p>{{ entry.summary }}</p>
    </aside>
  </header>

  <div class="lz-section-heading lz-case-subhead"><div><span class="lz-small">FIELD LOG / {{ entry.id }}</span><h3>Réduire la panne.</h3></div><span class="lz-section-symbol">↘</span></div>
  <div class="lz-case-layout">
    <div class="lz-timeline">
      {% for step in entry.steps %}
      <div class="lz-timeline-entry">
        <div class="lz-timeline-index"><span>{{ step.id }}</span><small>{{ step.date }}</small></div>
        <div class="lz-timeline-copy"><h4>{{ step.label }}</h4><p>{{ step.text }}</p></div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <aside class="lz-case-data">
      <div class="lz-case-data-heading"><b>RESULTS / OBSERVED</b><span class="lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="验证" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="yànzhèng" data-rrt4-meaning="Vérification, validation">验证</span></div>
      {% for signal in entry.signals %}
      <div class="lz-datum"><small>{{ signal.label }}</small><strong>{{ signal.value }}</strong></div>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="lz-data-foot">MESURES DATÉES / OCT. 2026<br>PAS DE MONITORING PUBLIC EN DIRECT</div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <section class="lz-evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-{{ entry.id }}">
    <div class="lz-section-heading"><div><span class="lz-small">EVIDENCE / INTERPRETATION</span><h3 id="evidence-{{ entry.id }}">Ce que les essais disent.</h3></div><span class="lz-section-symbol lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="证据" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="zhèngjù" data-rrt4-meaning="Preuve, élément probant">证据</span></div>
    <div class="lz-chain" role="img" aria-label="Chaîne d'accès : auparavant disque SATA, ancien pont USB et ordinateur, échec ; ensuite disque SATA, adaptateur Sabrent alimenté, ordinateur et KouboyPi, accès restauré.">
      <div class="lz-chain-label"><b>BEFORE</b><small>Communication perdue</small></div>
      <div class="lz-chain-path"><span>DISQUE SATA</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><span>ANCIEN PONT USB</span><i aria-hidden="true">×</i><span>PC / PI</span></div>
      <div class="lz-chain-label lz-good"><b>AFTER</b><small>Accès rétabli</small></div>
      <div class="lz-chain-path lz-recovered"><span>DISQUE SATA</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><span>SABRENT ALIMENTÉ</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><span>PC / PI</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lz-certainty-key" aria-label="Niveaux de certitude des constats"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> CONFIRMÉ</span><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> PROBABLE</span><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> NON ISOLÉ</span></div>
    <div class="lz-evidence-grid">
      {% for item in entry.observations %}
      <div class="lz-evidence-card lz-certainty-{{ loop.index }}">
        <span>{{ item.tag }}</span><h4>{{ item.title }}</h4><p>{{ item.text }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="lz-evidence-caption">{{ entry.evidenceNote }}</p>
    <div class="lz-proof-slots" aria-label="Emplacements prévus pour les photographies et les captures réelles">
      <figure class="lz-proof-slot">
        <div class="lz-proof-grid" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lz-proof-number">01</span><div class="lz-proof-placeholder"><span>□</span><small>PHOTO / SOURCE ORIGINALE</small></div></div>
        <figcaption><b>DOCUMENT À VENIR / PHOTOGRAPHIE</b><span>Disque, boîtier et adaptateur. À sélectionner et anonymiser avant publication.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="lz-proof-slot">
        <div class="lz-proof-grid" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lz-proof-number">02</span><div class="lz-proof-placeholder"><span>≋</span><small>CAPTURE / ÉTAT SMART</small></div></div>
        <figcaption><b>DOCUMENT À VENIR / CONTRÔLE</b><span>Capture du diagnostic, datée et expurgée des identifiants.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lz-outcome" aria-labelledby="outcome-{{ entry.id }}">
    <div class="lz-outcome-marker">03 / OUTCOME <span class="lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="结果" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="jiéguǒ" data-rrt4-meaning="Résultat">结果</span></div>
    <div><h3 id="outcome-{{ entry.id }}">Une panne de moins.<br>Un disque de plus.</h3><p>{{ entry.outcome }}</p><a href="kouboypi.html">VOIR LE PROJET KOUBOYPI <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="lz-lessons">
    <div class="lz-section-heading"><div><span class="lz-small">04 / WHAT STAYED</span><h3>Ce qu'on garde.</h3></div><span class="lz-section-symbol lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="收获" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="shōuhuò" data-rrt4-meaning="Acquis, ce qu’on en retire">收获</span></div>
    <div class="lz-lessons-grid">{% for lesson in entry.lessons %}<div><b>L{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</b><p>{{ lesson }}</p></div>{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>
</article>
{% endfor %}
<section class="lz-closing">
  <div class="lz-closing-title"><small>LAZARE / NEXT RECORD</small><strong>À SUIVRE.</strong></div>
  <div><p>Le registre est ouvert. Les prochains dossiers seront ajoutés lorsqu'une intervention aura produit des observations et des résultats vérifiables, pas simplement une promesse de réparation.</p><a href="atelier.html#atelier-work">← RETOUR AUX PROJETS DE L’ATELIER</a></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="footer atelier-footer lz-footer">
  <div class="footer-main">
    <strong>LAZARE<br>FIELD REGISTER</strong>
    <div class="project-footer-joke">{{ themeMark("repair") | safe }}<span><b>WORKSHOP NOTE / 001</b><br>Avant de déclarer mort, vérifier l'alimentation.</span></div>
    <div class="footer-languages"><span>FR / CONTENT</span><span>EN / UI</span><span>ZH / SIGNS + PINYIN</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-side"><div>ATELIER / REPAIR & ARCHIVE<br><span class="lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="修复" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="xiūfù" data-rrt4-meaning="Réparer, restaurer">修复</span> / <span class="lz-glyph" lang="zh-Hans" data-rrt4-gloss="记录" data-rrt4-language="zh" data-rrt4-reading="jìlù" data-rrt4-meaning="Journal, consignation">记录</span> / 2026</div><div>FIELD REGISTER / {{ lazare.edition }}</div></div>
</footer>
<script src="rrt4-safe.js"></script>
<script src="rrt4-lexicon.js"></script>
<script src="lazare-motion.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
